      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IAtr">I Atr</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðæm men ðe eallum folc ungetrywe sy.] [Ld] ⁊ gyf hwylc man sy ðe eallon folc ungetrywe sy, fare ðæs cynges gerefa to ⁊ gebringe hine under borge þæt hine man to rihte gelǽde ðam ðe him onspæcon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if there is anyone regarded with suspicion by the general public, the king's reeve shall go and place him under surety so that he may be brought to do justice to those who have made charges against him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hwylc man sy, þe eallon folc ungetrywe sy, fare þæs cynges gerefa ⁊ to gebringe hine under borge, þæt hine man tó rihte gelæde þam þe him onspræcon.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
